name bengali
category Package
revision 55475
catalogue bengali-pandey
shortdesc Support for the Bengali language
longdesc The package is based on Velthuis' transliteration scheme, with
longdesc extensions to deal with the Bengali letters that are not in
longdesc Devanagari. The package also supports Assamese.
